# ==============================================================================
# KODA PLATFORM — DOCKERIGNORE
# Comprehensive exclusion patterns for fast, lightweight Docker build contexts
# ==============================================================================

# Dependencies
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store

# Build & Runtime Outputs
**/.next
**/dist
**/out
**/.turbo

# Git & Version Control
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# Logs
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Environment files
**/.env
**/.env*.local
**/*.env

# Test & Coverage
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.test.ts

# Documentation & Scratch Files
documentation
.gemini
.agents
tmp
scratch
